      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start for the pro side. some of the neighbors are being really vocal about how this'll mess up the neighborhood character and create too much traffic, but it feels like they just don't get the bigger picture. how should i address those kinds of complaints in my presentation to show them why the development is actually the more logical path forward?",
