      "role": "user",
      "content": "so basically how do i frame it so they see their concerns as just being obstacles to necessary progress? i want to make sure they don't derail the meeting by making it all about 'preserving history' or whatever. is there a way to just present the benefits as the only real way for the city to actually function in the long run?",
